\" width=\"161\">Elongation Shrinkage<\/td><td width=\"70\">Warp<\/td><td width=\"255\">3%<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"70\">Weft<\/td><td width=\"255\">1.5%<\/td><\/tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"231\">Weight<\/td><td width=\"255\">1600g\/m\u00b2<\/td><\/tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"231\">Joint<\/td><td width=\"255\">Steel buckle joint\uff0c seamless connection<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><h3>Features<\/h3><ol><li>Low elongation, \u00a0good\u00a0adhesion;<\/li><li>Not easy to be out of shape under high temperature;<\/li><li>Anti-static and\u00a0nontoxic;<\/li><li>It is suitable for short distance and small conveying capacity.<\/li><\/ol><h3>Application<\/h3><p>Cotton conveyor belt is mainly used for FOOD INDUSTRY\u00a0and usually match with FOOD MACHINERY. Such as conveying for\u00a0steamed bread, biscuit, and fruits and\u00a0pharmaceutical Industry. Besides, our cotton conveyor belt also can be\u00a0used in machinery industry,\u00a0electronics industry, logistics industry and\u00a0chemical industry.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ff42c94 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ff42c94\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c24e567 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"c24e567\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Cotton-Conveyor-Belt-04-detail1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3653\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Cotton-Conveyor-Belt-04-detail1.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Cotton-Conveyor-Belt-04-de